    "html": "<p>A satellite is in a stable circular orbit at height <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"h\"></span> above the surface of a planet of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M\"></span> and radius <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R\"></span>. Which of the following gives the total mechanical energy of the satellite?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-\\dfrac{GMm}{2R}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-\\dfrac{GMm}{R+h}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-\\dfrac{GMm}{2(R+h)}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\dfrac{GMm}{2(R+h)}\"></span></p></li></ol>"
  },
